    "reviews": "\u201cGrand Cross: Renovation is power and aggression focused in a constant balance of risk/reward, and a hugely entertaining shooter from start to finish.\u201d<br>HARDCORE GAMER<br><br>\u201cThe Sun Blade mechanic is a much-needed breath of fresh air in the shmup space, one hardcore fans will enjoy mastering.\u201d<br>80/100 \u2013 Gamers Heroes<br>",
